दन्तः + -उलूखलिकः, -उलूखलिन् m. one who uses his teeth for a mortar,
 (grinding grain to be eaten between his teeth), an anchorite; cf. Ms. 6. 17;
 Rām. 3. 6; Mb. 13. 141. 104.

दन्तः + -उलूखलिकः, -उलूखलिन् m. one who uses his teeth for a mortar,
